questions.q:
`rec.txt` contains `Sara 85`. What is printed?
```
char name[20];
int m;
FILE *fp = fopen("rec.txt", "r");
fscanf(fp, "%s %d", name, &m);
fclose(fp);
printf("%s got %d", name, m + 5);
```

What is printed?
```
int n = 27, d, prime = 1;
for (d = 2; d * d <= n; d++) {
    if (n % d == 0) {
        prime = 0;
        break;
    }
}
printf("%d %d", prime, d);
```
